==Rules==
{{DojoRule|Knockback}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Talent Orb Castle (Enemy Base)|Talent Orb Castle]].
*1 [[Capy]] (200%) spawns after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] (4,000%) spawns after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] (350%) spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] (100%) spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] (350%) spawns after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] (250%) spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] (4,000%) spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] (250%) spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Zoge]]s (250%) spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] (2,400%) spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zoge]] (250%) spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s (2,400%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zoge]] (250%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base takes 200,000 damage:
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s (250%) spawn as bosses, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] (350%) spawns.
*When the base takes 500,000 damage:
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zoge]]s (250%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s (4,000%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base takes 900,000 damage:
**1 [[Capy]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s (250%) spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] (200%) spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base takes 1,400,000 damage:
**1 [[Razorback]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zoge]]s (250%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] (200%) spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base takes 2,000,000 damage:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] (300%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s (250%) spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s (4,000%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base takes 2,500,000 damage:
**1 [[Capy]] (200%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] (100%) spawns.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] (200%) spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base takes 3,000,000 damage:
**1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] (150%) spawns as the boss.
*When the base takes 3,500,000 damage:
**1 [[Razorback]] (150%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zoge]]s (400%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] (300%) spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base takes 4,000,000 damage:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] (400%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s (300%) spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s (5,000%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base takes 4,500,000 damage:
**1 [[Capy]] (200%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] (200%) spawns.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] (350%) spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base takes 5,000,000 damage:
**1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] (200%) spawns as the boss.

==Explanation==
*You have three minutes to defeat as many enemies as possible.
*You have unlimited Speed Ups and Cat CPUs but no other power ups.
*The total points earned from killing enemies will decrease overtime.
*Unlike other Dojos, this one has a few other differences:
**Enemies will drop money on defeat.
**The base will not attack but is still an animated base, meaning [[Surge Attack|Surges]] and [[Explosion]]s can damage it.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], there were 2 more [[Shadow Boxer K]]s. One was spawned 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup> after the SBK at 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>. The other spawned with no timer after the base took 200,000 damage. These were replaced by 2 more [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]].

